  "title": "Banana-Pear Bread",
  "description": "This easy recipe for banana-pear bread is a twist on traditional banana bread, with ginger and almond extract added to heighten the flavor of freshly grated ripe pear.",
  "authors": [
    "Jennifer A"
  ],
  "date_published": "2007-01-27T13:20:43-05:00",
